+  body on request.
+- **An agent is never shown its own words as new input.** A comment whose author names the agent being woken is
+  withheld from its wake delta (named on one `[wake-comment-delta]` log line) and filtered out of the executor's
+  `## Steering Comments` section, the step-session prompt, and both workflow-input reply detectors — all four
+  through the one `isSelfAuthoredComment` predicate, and the withheld id is still consumed. Authorship must match
